    "AI Notes": {
      "value": "Barcelona-based photographer, filmmaker and art director (b. 1989), self-taught. Broke out art-directing Solange A Seat at the Table / When I Get Home (Cranes in the Sky, Dont Touch My Hair) and a Tate Modern performance; since then Dior, Givenchy, Mugler, Helmut Lang, Vogue, The New Yorker, and artists Rosalia, Arca, Rupi Kaur. Known for spiritual, light-soaked imagery of the female body. Highly senior, internationally recognised artist (~12+ yrs). Autonomy 5: directs her own vision end to end, agency-represented (We Folk). Freelance per her self-maintained site and IG. She also art-directs (Creative direction may fit, see Open Question).",
